name: recurrence
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a failure pattern already recorded in a concept was measured
  again on a new surface — same signature, new location. Fires when the
  diff is a fresh instance of a belief the repo already holds (an
  enumeration gap, a stale pin, an unwalked path) rather than a new
  finding — the concept grows a dated sighting, it does not change its
  claim. Sibling of addition: that one records a belief learned here;
  this one records a belief proven again.
